<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>atablefor — restaurant table booking (Kiosk demo)</title>
  <!-- Machine-readable affordance: assistants discover the Kiosk surface here. -->
  <link rel="kiosk" href="https://kiosk.tech/skill.md">
  <style>
    *,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
    body{font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,sans-serif;color:#2a1a12;background:#faf6f2;line-height:1.5}
    header{background:#8a3b1c;color:#fff;padding:0 32px;height:60px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}
    .logo{font-size:22px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.5px}
    .logo span{color:#ffcf9b}
    .wrap{max-width:820px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px}
    .hero{margin:44px auto 0;text-align:center}
    .hero h1{font-size:30px;line-height:1.15;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:10px}
    .hero p{font-size:17px;color:#68544a}
    .tag{display:inline-block;margin-top:14px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:#8a3b1c;background:#f7e6da;border-radius:999px;padding:5px 13px}
    .pow-note{max-width:820px;margin:20px auto 0;font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.5;color:#7a3113;background:#fbeadb;border:1px solid #eccbb2;border-left:4px solid #8a3b1c;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 16px}

    /* ── Live activity stat cards ─────────────────────────────────────── */
    .stats-h{margin:44px auto 14px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#98847a;text-align:center}
    .stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(150px,1fr));gap:14px}
    .stat{background:#fff;border:1px solid #efe2d8;border-radius:14px;padding:22px 16px;text-align:center}
    .stat .n{font-size:30px;font-weight:800;color:#8a3b1c;line-height:1}
    .stat .l{margin-top:8px;font-size:13px;color:#786055;font-weight:600}

    /* ── Poke section ─────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
    .poke{margin:40px auto 0;background:#33190f;color:#f7ece4;border-radius:16px;padding:26px 28px}
    .poke h2{font-size:18px;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:6px}
    .poke p{font-size:14px;color:#d1b8a9;margin-bottom:16px}
    .poke pre{background:#221008;border:1px solid #48281e;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;overflow-x:auto}
    .poke code{font-family:"SF Mono","Fira Mono",monospace;font-size:13px;color:#f0c69f;white-space:pre}
    .poke .links{margin-top:16px;display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}
    .poke a{background:rgba(255,255,255,.10);color:#fff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;padding:9px 14px;border-radius:9px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.20)}
    .poke a:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.2)}
    footer{text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#b09a8d;padding:34px 0 40px}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="logo">atable<span>for</span></div>
    <nav style="font-size:13px;opacity:.9">table reservations · no payment</nav>
  </header>

  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="pow-note">⚠ This demo runs production-grade proof-of-work (~9–10&nbsp;s per register) on purpose — so you can feel the real anti-reservation-scalping toll first-hand. The other Kiosk demos are tuned light (sub-second) for quick poking.</p>

    <section class="hero">
      <h1>Book a table for two, tomorrow at 8.</h1>
      <p>A restaurant that takes reservations over the Kiosk wire — completed by an assistant, no human present, no card. Seeded operator: Mamma Pizza.</p>
      <span class="tag">Kiosk demo operator · capabilities [schema, query, run]</span>
    </section>

    <h3 class="stats-h">Live activity</h3>
    <section class="stats">
      <div class="stat">
        <div class="n"><%= @tables_booked %></div>
        <div class="l">Tables booked</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat">
        <div class="n"><%= @covers_seated %></div>
        <div class="l">Covers seated</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat">
        <div class="n"><%= @cancellations %></div>
        <div class="l">Cancellations</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat">
        <div class="n"><%= @open_slots %></div>
        <div class="l">Open table slots</div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="poke">
      <h2>Poke it — this operator speaks Kiosk</h2>
      <p>Your assistant can check availability and book over the wire. Start at the discovery handshake, then read the schema:</p>
      <pre><code>curl -s http://localhost:3000/.well-known/kiosk.json | jq .
curl -s http://localhost:3000/kiosk/schema | jq .</code></pre>
      <div class="links">
        <a href="/.well-known/kiosk.json">/.well-known/kiosk.json</a>
        <a href="/kiosk/schema">/kiosk/schema</a>
        <a href="https://kiosk.tech/skill.md">skill.md</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>

  <footer>atablefor — demo provider — powered by Kiosk</footer>
</body>
</html>
